          "_name": "features038",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features38\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Image</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Height\" name=\"imageHeight\" min=\"3\" max=\"6\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"autoSize\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f7f7f7\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Leading Lines</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>引导线构图</b><br>画面中楼梯扶手和建筑梁柱形成了多条倾斜的平行线条，在视觉上构成了强烈的几何框架<br><br>这些倾斜的斜线像箭头一样，直接将观众的视线引向画面中心正在沿楼梯走动的人群（戴帽子的行人、挑担的挑夫等），增强了画面的流动感与故事感<br><br>来源: 网络摄影照<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get started</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/0.webp\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row row-reverse justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Low Angle</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>\n                        低角度构图<br></b>摄像机的机位被安置在角色的胸部或更低的位置，镜头往上抬高朝向人物拍摄<br><br>&nbsp;这种仰拍视角拉长了主体的视觉身形，将观众置于弱势或平视以下的观察位，完美地烘托出蜘蛛侠面对庞大未知危机时的英勇、震撼以及人物的史诗感<br><br>来源: 电影<br>《Avengers: Infinity War》2018 ‧ Action/Sci-fi <br>\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get started</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/screenshot-2026-10-07-at-11.13.25am-4.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>We think in images</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Donec egestas massa vel nulla gravida\n                        pulvinar. Pellentesque habitant morbi tristique senectus et netus et malesuada fames ac turpis\n                        egestas.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get started</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"../_images/gallery/gallery02.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vxkzBv0Yzq",
          "_anchor": "features038-3",
